      {
        "id": "existence-uniqueness-distinct",
        "moduleId": "independence-and-map",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材定义：两个互相独立的性质",
        "markdown": "Existence（存在性）与 uniqueness（唯一性）是两个**互相独立**的性质：存在未必唯一。这里的“唯一”指的是“**若存在则唯一**”，所以证得唯一也未必证得存在。因此存在性与唯一性要分开讨论、分别证明。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d79ad0eadaa0dc69704ecc53",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000008"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Methods of Proof",
                "Existence and Uniqueness的證明"
              ],
              "lineStart": 204,
              "lineEnd": 238,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "0899e9a6f8db55f150cbcc49bf98283314f790a36ad5b3a3c4a78698c9801f27"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-two-separate-questions",
        "moduleId": "independence-and-map",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "把命题拆成两个问题",
        "markdown": "判断一个“存在且唯一”的命题时，先把它拆成两个独立问题：\n\n- 存在性问题：有没有至少一个对象满足条件？\n- 唯一性问题：**假设**已经存在满足条件的对象，是否至多只有一个？\n\n只证明“至多一个”并不能回答“有没有”。例如在实数范围内，方程 $x^2+1=0$ 没有解，此时讨论解的唯一性没有意义；反过来，一个条件也可能被多个对象满足。存在与唯一互不蕴含，因此证明时必须分别交代。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "existence-uniqueness-distinct"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "existence-two-methods",
        "moduleId": "existence-two-methods",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "教材方法：构造法与非构造法",
        "markdown": "存在性的证明大致分为两类：\n\n- **constructive method（构造法）**：确实指出存在的对象是什么，并说明它满足条件。\n- **nonconstructive method（非构造法）**：借助已知理论或逻辑推导，断定对象一定存在，但未必能指出是哪一个。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d79ad0eadaa0dc69704ecc53",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000008"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Methods of Proof",
                "Existence and Uniqueness的證明"
              ],
              "lineStart": 204,
              "lineEnd": 238,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "0899e9a6f8db55f150cbcc49bf98283314f790a36ad5b3a3c4a78698c9801f27"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-method-comparison",
        "moduleId": "existence-two-methods",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "comparison",
        "title": "两条路线怎么选",
        "markdown": "| 维度 | 构造法 | 非构造法 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 是否给出具体对象 | 给出 | 通常不给出 |\n| 主要工作 | 找候选并验证 | 用定理或逻辑推出存在 |\n| 常见工具 | 因式分解、显式构造 | 中间值定理、鸽笼原理、反证法 |\n| 主要风险 | 只推出候选值却漏掉代回验证 | 断定了存在却无法指名对象 |\n\n若题目要求给出实例，或能直接找到可验证的对象，优先用构造法；若对象难以显式写出，但能借助已知定理保证存在，则用非构造法。选择依据是能否**验证结论**，而不是哪种写法看起来更短。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "existence-two-methods"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "constructive-quadratic",
        "moduleId": "constructive-verification",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "教材例：因式分解构造一个根",
        "markdown": "要证明存在实数 $x$ 满足 $6x^2-x-1=0$，可以因式分解：\n\n$$6x^2-x-1=(2x-1)(3x+1)$$\n\n于是取 $x=\\frac{1}{2}$（或 $x=-\\frac{1}{3}$），代入即可验证它确实满足方程。这是 constructive method：对象被明确指出，并通过代入确认。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d79ad0eadaa0dc69704ecc53",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000008"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Methods of Proof",
                "Existence and Uniqueness的證明"
              ],
              "lineStart": 204,
              "lineEnd": 238,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "0899e9a6f8db55f150cbcc49bf98283314f790a36ad5b3a3c4a78698c9801f27"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-constructive-verification",
        "moduleId": "constructive-verification",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "构造法的重点是验证",
        "markdown": "构造法的重点不是“猜出”对象，而是**验证**。上例中因式分解同时给出了候选值，以及它使左边为零的理由；若只写出候选值而不代回，就没有完成存在性证明。\n\n因此构造法可以概括为两步：\n\n1. 给出一个或多个候选对象；\n2. 把它们代回原条件，逐一确认确实成立。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "constructive-quadratic"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "candidate-not-solution",
        "moduleId": "constructive-verification",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "教材反例：候选值不等于解",
        "markdown": "教材用一个反面例子说明代回验证的必要性。问是否存在实数 $x$ 满足\n\n$$\\sqrt{3-2x}=x-2$$\n\n若假设有解，两边平方得 $3-2x=x^2-4x+4$，即 $x^2-2x+1=0$，只能得到 $x=1$。把 $x=1$ 代回原式得到 $1=-1$，不成立，因此原方程没有实数解。\n\n推导只说明“若有解则只能是 $x=1$”，并不自动产生解。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d79ad0eadaa0dc69704ecc53",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000008"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Methods of Proof",
                "Existence and Uniqueness的證明"
              ],
              "lineStart": 204,
              "lineEnd": 238,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "0899e9a6f8db55f150cbcc49bf98283314f790a36ad5b3a3c4a78698c9801f27"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-candidate-pitfall",
        "moduleId": "constructive-verification",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "warning",
        "title": "常见错误：把候选值当成解",
        "markdown": "由“若有解则 $x=1$”推出“$x=1$ 是解”，是一次逻辑跳跃。正确写法是先在假设解存在的前提下筛出候选，再逐一**代回原式**检验。\n\n若所有候选都不满足，得到的是“不存在解”，是对存在性的否定，而不是存在性的证明。这也是构造法必须包含验证步骤的原因。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "candidate-not-solution"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "nonconstructive-ivt",
        "moduleId": "nonconstructive-tools",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "教材例：用中间值定理证明存在性",
        "markdown": "同一个方程 $6x^2-x-1=0$ 也可以用非构造法证明存在性。令 $f(x)=6x^2-x-1$，则\n\n$$f(0)=-1<0,\\qquad f(1)=4>0$$\n\n多项式函数连续，由连续函数的中间值定理，$f(x)=0$ 在 $0<x<1$ 之间必有根。这个方法断定了根的存在，却没有指出具体的 $x$，因此是 nonconstructive method。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-d79ad0eadaa0dc69704ecc53",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000008"
              ],
